  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Center for International Stabilization and Recovery (CISR) Core Services to Weapons Removal and Abatement (WRA) Programs 2017-2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JMU Center for International Stabilization and Recovery (CISR) provides management training for organizations that clear land contaminated with explosive remnants of war (ERW), peer support training and capacity-building for disability rights organizations, and works with JMU faculty to develop tools and conduct research to help communities and individuals rebuild their lives in post-conflict environments.</narrative>
  </description>
